 security:["Use project-level RBAC and managed identities for connected resources; do not treat a Foundry project role as permission to every data source.","Apply Content Safety, prompt shields, groundedness evaluation and output validation according to the risk of the application.","Keep prompts, traces, uploaded files and evaluation data within the intended region and retention boundary; scrub regulated data before logging."],
