 watch:["Translation quality depends on context, domain terms, locale and source ambiguity; it is not a proof-preserving transformation.","Do not lose the source language or source document identity when indexing translated output.","Language detection errors can route text to the wrong glossary or downstream model."],
 cost:["Characters, documents/pages, custom terminology, storage, egress and downstream review/indexing drive total cost.","Repeated translation of unchanged strings is avoidable with content hashes and translation memory.","Include human post-editing and retranslation when quality is a product requirement."],
