 optimization:["Choose model deployment and context size from measured quality/latency/token behavior; trim irrelevant retrieval context.","Use streaming for user experience, batching for offline work and caching for stable system prompts or embeddings where appropriate.","Separate model quota from application concurrency and implement bounded retries to avoid retry storms."],
