 optimization:["Select the narrowest prebuilt or custom model and avoid running multiple extractors over documents that do not need them.","Use asynchronous batches for backlogs and confidence-based review rather than manually reviewing every high-confidence result.","Store normalized fields for application queries while retaining source references for audit and reprocessing."],
